Pishan is an android of [[Org/Radiant Arms/index|Radiant Arms]], dwarven in height and build. Like the others of the company his skin is left clear in places, showing the working beneath. He moved out with the rest of his people when Radiant Arms gave up its berth to join the Party's coalition.
